</div>



<p>That is a complete Agent Skill. Save it as <code>explain/SKILL.md</code>, point your agent at it, and the agent will follow these instructions precisely whenever the skill is activated.</p>

<h3>
  <a name="optional-resources" href="https://dev.to/loc_carrre_0d798813c662/agent-skills-explained-what-they-are-what-they-arent-and-how-to-use-them-bf9#optional-resources">
