<p>The skill instructions are injected as a user message (via <code>SkillInjectionMode.UserMessage</code>). LM-Kit.NET also supports <code>SystemPrompt</code> (prepend to system prompt) and <code>ToolResult</code> (return as tool output) injection modes.</p>


